; Test 06: COMPILER/CREATE EXECUTABLE through the menu (no runtime error
; checks).  File requester of blitz2 -> TEDRUN:work/t01_int, wait for the
; end of COMPILING, QUIT.  Compared: executable A<->B (and later against
; the tedstub result), requester sequence.
; @source T t01_int
; @xtra norunerr
; @est 6
; @expect corpus t01_int t01_int
; @expect exists t01_int.info
; @expect same t01_int.bb2
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait screen
menu 4 2
wait freq "Name of Executable to create"
timeout 30
freq ok "t01_int" "TEDRUN:work"
timeout 10
wait screen
dump compiled
menu 0 9
wait exit
